# L §6.1 Joint models: "use a = \"file\" sha256 \"…\" in the header imports a closed model ... A file that doesn't
# match its hash is refused (LOAD-PIN)." The member ana.tally is imported, not one of the reality's files; its sha256
# is not 0000.
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "0000"
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PIN ...
